   ("Videos and photos", "Frame-rate and resolution conversion and noise reduction all happen on your device. EnhanceVid never uploads your videos or photos to us or to third parties. Photo library access is used only to read the video you pick and to save the result as a new item. Originals are never changed or deleted."),
   ("Advertising", "EnhanceVid shows ads through Google AdMob. To serve ads, Google may collect and process device information, the advertising identifier, approximate location (based on IP address) and ad interaction data. In the EEA, the UK and Switzerland a consent form is shown before personalized ads. On iOS you can allow or deny tracking through App Tracking Transparency; if you deny or don't consent, non-personalized ads are shown. Either way, every feature works the same."),
   ("Analytics and crash reports", "EnhanceVid uses Google Firebase (Analytics and Crashlytics) to understand how the app is used and to diagnose crashes so we can fix and improve it. This includes app events such as the number of videos enhanced or features used — never the content of your videos. Crash reports include diagnostic information about the device and the error."),
